10 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"809\" y=\"513\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1248\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2249,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"3250\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"4045\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(5045,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> using the square of difference formula. We perform the following steps:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p>Write the constant term as a perfect square:\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"14.687ex\" height=\"3.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.005ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -934.9 6323.8 1367.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"8\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 5.962em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right;\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"verti